{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Pushing it! Together - Sisyphus Co-op",
    "steam_appid": 3298460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>An online co-op game about pushing a boulder up a hill with your friends.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pushing It! Together</i></strong>\u00a0is a multiplayer successor to <strong><i>Pushing it! With Sisyphus</i></strong>, a difficult and punishing game inspired by Greek mythology, where you play as Sisyphus - a man cursed to an eternity of rolling a boulder up a mountain, destined to never reach the top.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>But this time, you're not alone anymore.</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't always be easy between you, and sometimes there may be some fighting. But your job is to learn how to work past your differences, to work as a team. Towards one common goal: <i>Pushing it! <u>Together.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the boulder by walking/running into it together, and try to reach the top, collecting hats and boulder skins along the way. Be careful though, as a ton of obstacles, surprises, and friendships awaits you ahead.\u00a0Try not to fall, as a single bad slip is all it takes to be back at the beginning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll a boulder up a hill in lobbies of 2-4 people. You can also try solo, but good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hats and boulder skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap your teammates to put them in thier place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all your progress at a single slip, and have no one to blame but yourself. Or your teammates. Yeah, it was totally thier fault this time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience levels of frustration not previously thought possible as you restrain yourself from killing each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pushing.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realize the true treasure isn't the reward at the top, but the friendships you made along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike in the previous game, there's hope this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because  you're not alone anymore. You've got each other.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>An online co-op game about pushing a boulder up a hill with your friends.</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pushing It! Together</i></strong>\u00a0is a multiplayer successor to <strong><i>Pushing it! With Sisyphus</i></strong>, a difficult and punishing game inspired by Greek mythology, where you play as Sisyphus - a man cursed to an eternity of rolling a boulder up a mountain, destined to never reach the top.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>But this time, you're not alone anymore.</u>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't always be easy between you, and sometimes there may be some fighting. But your job is to learn how to work past your differences, to work as a team. Towards one common goal: <i>Pushing it! <u>Together.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push the boulder by walking/running into it together, and try to reach the top, collecting hats and boulder skins along the way. Be careful though, as a ton of obstacles, surprises, and friendships awaits you ahead.\u00a0Try not to fall, as a single bad slip is all it takes to be back at the beginning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll a boulder up a hill in lobbies of 2-4 people. You can also try solo, but good luck with that!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect hats and boulder skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap your teammates to put them in thier place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose all your progress at a single slip, and have no one to blame but yourself. Or your teammates. Yeah, it was totally thier fault this time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience levels of frustration not previously thought possible as you restrain yourself from killing each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep pushing.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realize the true treasure isn't the reward at the top, but the friendships you made along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike in the previous game, there's hope this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because  you're not alone anymore. You've got each other.</p>",
    "short_description": "Roll a boulder up a hill with your friends in this Online Co-op adventure based off the ancient Myth of Sisyphus.",
